#: Game/Levels/OrderMatters/L03_Counterexample.lean:8
msgid "A generalization is refuted by a counterexample, and the last two levels supply one: Middle Kleene\n"
"conjunction is not commutative. This time prove it without §0, in three steps.\n"
"\n"
"1. §1 assumes the generalization, under the name §2. The goal becomes §3.\n"
"2. §4 instantiates §5 at the counterexample.\n"
"3. §6 computes both sides of §7, finds that it says §8, and closes the goal, since\n"
"   a false assumption proves anything."
msgstr ""

